-- 046_remove_fixture_intelligence.sql
--
-- migrations/004_add_comprehensive_tests.sql inserted deterministic demo rows
-- (fake strategic opportunities, threats, workspaces, pipeline deals, supplier
-- risks, queue items, team assignments and source evidence) directly into the
-- schema. In production those rows contaminate the executive dashboard, threat
-- metrics, pipeline totals, triage queue and any downstream evaluation.
--
-- 004 is already applied and therefore must not be edited (sqlx checksums).
-- This migration removes exactly those deterministic fixture IDs. It is
-- idempotent and deletes nothing else.

